    "result": "Perfect! All tests pass. Here's a summary of what I've implemented:\n\n## Weekly Subscription Support Added \u2713\n\nI've successfully added weekly subscription support to subtrack. Here's what changed:\n\n### Core Changes\n\n**cycles.js:**\n- Added `WEEK: 'weekly'` to supported billing cycles\n- Updated `MONTHS_PER_CHARGE` to calculate weekly costs as `12/52` (52 weeks per year \u00f7 12 months)\n- Changed rounding from `Math.floor` to `Math.round` for more accurate monthly costs\n- Updated `nextCharge()` to handle weekly cycles (adds 7 days per charge)\n\n**CLI (bin/subtrack.js):**\n- Updated usage message to show `--every month|week|year`\n- Added support for both `--every week` and `--every weekly`\n- Updated error messages to mention \"week\" as valid option\n- Changed `total` command to sum rounded monthly costs for consistency\n\n**Export & Renewals:**\n- Updated `export.js` to calculate and round weekly plan costs\n- Fixed sorting bug in `renewals.js` (now sorts by date instead of text label)\n\n### Test Results\n- All 39 tests pass \u2713\n- New tests verify: weekly monthly cost calculations, 7-day intervals, CLI integration\n\n### End-to-End Verification\n```bash\n# Works as expected:\nsubtrack add \"Meal kit\" 59.90 --every week\n# Output: Added Meal kit: \u20ac59.90 weekly, \u20ac259.57 a month.\n\nsubtrack list\n# Output: Meal kit  \u20ac59.90 weekly  \u20ac259.57 a month\n\nsubtrack total\n# Output: Monthly total: \u20ac259.57 (1 plan)\n\nsubtrack renewals\n# Shows next charge in 7-day intervals\n```\n\nThe implementation is complete and fully tested!",
